  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sauver les vies &#xe0; travers le renforcement de l&#x2019;acc&#xe8;s des femmes et filles vuln&#xe9;rables et des survivant-e-s de Violence Bas&#xe9;e sur le Genre aux services de prise en charge int&#xe9;gr&#xe9;e.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this project is to provide protection against gender-based violence to vulnerable communities affected by conflict-related displacement in Ouahigouya, Boulsa, Kongoussi, and Bogande. This UNFPA project provides medical services and psychosocial support to survivors of gender-based violence and dignity kits to women and girls. This project supports a total of 4,837 people, of whom 90% are women and girls. 725 persons with disabilities are also supported.</narrative>
  </description>
